<tbody>
<tr><td><code>im-stack-xs</code> … <code>im-stack-xl</code></td><td><code>--im-stack-gap</code>, 0.5rem to 4rem</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>im-section-tight</code> · <code>im-section-sm</code></td><td><code>--im-section-gap</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>im-grid-sm</code> … <code>im-grid-lg</code></td><td><code>--im-grid-min</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>im-max-sm</code> · <code>im-max-md</code> · <code>im-max-lg</code></td><td>a measure cap</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>im-single-aside-sm|md</code></td><td>the rail's width</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>im-art-<em>collection</em></code></td><td><code>--im-art</code>, the head pattern's colour</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>im-cluster-tight</code> · <code>im-m0</code> · <code>im-mx-auto</code> · <code>im-center</code></td><td>the small ones</td></tr>
